# Data fixtures are stored and checked out byte for byte: a TA Instruments
# export is CRLF and its tests pin that, an OMNIC export too; git's
# line-ending conversion must never touch them (it turned
# EXAMPLES/DTA_cycles_example.txt into LF on the Linux CI runner).
EXAMPLES/** -text
*.spa binary
*.mapx binary
*.mth binary
*.rasx binary
*.prism binary
*.edf.gz binary
*.zip binary
# Windows batch files run through cmd.exe, which expects CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
